/E (Today we are a large, diverse and passionate team of male and female counsellors and psychotherapists who bring a valuable range of differing perspectives and practice knowledge. We are flexible and adaptable and respond proactively to change. We take a CPD-led approach focusing on the importance of reflective practice, safeguarding, accurately accessing needs and risks, and empowering people. Together we have extensive experience around psychoeducation and a wide range of counselling orientations, including person centred, creative and play based therapy, cognitive behavioural therapy \(CBT\) and integrative therapy. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
