/Title (Between April 2024 and March 2025 the work of You and Me Counselling helped to successfully address the ongoing support gap across North East London, meeting the needs of 396 young people and family members through over 3,504 hours of counselling. We did this by going to where young people are, providing early intervention and on-demand counselling, preventing emotional needs from developing into mental health issues.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2565 0 R
/Prev 2681 0 R
/Next 2672 0 R
>>
endobj
